<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Amor Profundo — Reconecte-se com Seu Parceiro</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,600;1,300;1,400&family=Jost:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  :root {
    --rose: #c8796a;
    --blush: #f2d9d3;
    --cream: #faf6f2;
    --deep: #1e1410;
    --gold: #c9a96e;
    --muted: #8a7060;
  }

  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  body {
    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
    background: var(--cream);
    color: var(--deep);
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* ── HERO ── */
  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-left {
    background: var(--deep);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 80px 60px 80px 80px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .hero-left::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    right: -1px;
    top: 0;
    height: 100%;
    width: 80px;
    background: var(--deep);
    clip-path: polygon(0 0, 0 100%, 100% 100%);
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .badge::before {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    width: 30px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--gold);
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: clamp(52px, 5vw, 80px);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--cream);
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .hero h1 em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--rose);
  }

  .hero-desc {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #b0a090;
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 380px;
    margin-bottom: 50px;
  }

  .cta-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
    max-width: 320px;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--rose);
    color: white;
    border: none;
    padding: 18px 36px;
    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-align: center;
    display: block;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: #b5685a; transform: translateX(4px); }

  .btn-ghost {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--cream);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    padding: 18px 36px;
    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-align: center;
    display: block;
  }
  .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--gold); color: var(--gold); }

  .hero-right {
    background: var(--blush);
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 60px 40px 0;
  }

  .hero-visual {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 480px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .couple-card {
    background: white;
    padding: 48px 40px;
    position: relative;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .couple-card::before {
    content: '"';
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 120px;
    color: var(--rose);
    position: absolute;
    top: -20px;
    left: 30px;
    line-height: 1;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .couple-card p {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--deep);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .couple-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .avatar-pair {
    display: flex;
  }
  .avatar {
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 3px solid white;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 18px;
    background: var(--blush);
  }
  .avatar:last-child { margin-left: -12px; background: #f0c8c0; }

  .couple-name {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--deep);
    display: block;
  }
  .couple-sub {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .floating-stat {
    position: absolute;
    background: white;
    padding: 16px 22px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  .floating-stat:nth-child(2) { top: 15%; right: -20px; animation-delay: 0.5s; }
  .floating-stat:nth-child(3) { top: 40%; left: -20px; animation-delay: 1.2s; }

  @keyframes float {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
  }

  .stat-num {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--rose);
    display: block;
  }
  .stat-label { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 1px; }

  /* ── SECTION HEADINGS ── */
  .section-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--rose);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .section-label::before {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    width: 24px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--rose);
  }

  .section-title {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 4vw, 56px);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--deep);
  }
  .section-title em { font-style: italic; color: var(--rose); }

  /* ── PROBLEMS ── */
  .problems {
    padding: 120px 80px;
    background: white;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 100px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .problems-text .section-title { margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .problems-text p {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 460px;
  }

  .pain-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
  }
  .pain-item {
    padding: 28px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #f0ebe5;
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateX(30px);
    transition: all 0.6s ease;
  }
  .pain-item.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }

  .pain-num {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 42px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--blush);
    line-height: 1;
    min-width: 50px;
  }
  .pain-text h3 {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    color: var(--deep);
  }
  .pain-text p {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* ── METHOD ── */
  .method {
    padding: 120px 80px;
    background: var(--deep);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .method::before {
    content: 'AMOR';
    position: absolute;
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 300px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .method-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 80px;
  }
  .method-header .section-label { justify-content: center; }
  .method-header .section-title { color: var(--cream); }

  .method-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .method-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    padding: 50px 40px;
    transition: background 0.3s ease;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .method-card:hover { background: rgba(200,121,106,0.12); }

  .method-card::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 0;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--rose);
    transition: width 0.4s ease;
  }
  .method-card:hover::after { width: 100%; }

  .method-icon {
    font-size: 36px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    display: block;
  }
  .method-card h3 {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--cream);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .method-card p {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: rgba(250,246,242,0.55);
  }

  /* ── TESTIMONIALS ── */
  .testimonials {
    padding: 120px 80px;
    background: var(--blush);
  }
  .test-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }

  .test-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .test-card {
    background: white;
    padding: 40px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .test-card.featured { background: var(--deep); }

  .test-stars {
    color: var(--gold);
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .test-card p {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    color: var(--deep);
  }
  .test-card.featured p { color: var(--cream); font-size: 24px; }

  .test-person {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .test-avatar {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--blush);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 20px;
  }
  .test-card.featured .test-avatar { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }
  .test-name { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--deep); }
  .test-card.featured .test-name { color: var(--cream); }
  .test-since { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }
  .test-card.featured .test-since { color: rgba(250,246,242,0.5); }

  .test-small {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .test-small .test-card { padding: 28px 28px; }
  .test-small .test-card p { font-size: 16px; }

  /* ── CTA ── */
  .final-cta {
    padding: 140px 80px;
    background: white;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 100px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .cta-content .section-title { margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .cta-content > p {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 50px;
    max-width: 440px;
  }

  .price-box {
    background: var(--cream);
    padding: 50px 40px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .price-label { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .price-val {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 72px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--deep);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .price-val sup { font-size: 28px; vertical-align: super; }
  .price-period { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .price-includes {
    list-style: none;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }
  .price-includes li {
    font-size: 14px;
    padding: 10px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ede8e2;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    color: var(--deep);
  }
  .price-includes li::before {
    content: '✦';
    color: var(--rose);
    font-size: 10px;
  }

  .btn-full {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--rose);
    color: white;
    border: none;
    padding: 20px;
    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    text-align: center;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .btn-full:hover { background: #b5685a; }

  .guarantee {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 14px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  /* ── FOOTER ── */
  footer {
    background: var(--deep);
    padding: 50px 80px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .footer-brand {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--cream);
  }
  .footer-brand span { color: var(--rose); }
  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 30px;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .footer-links a {
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(250,246,242,0.4);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.3s;
  }
  .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--rose); }
  .footer-copy {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: rgba(250,246,242,0.3);
  }

  /* ── REVEAL ANIMATION ── */
  .reveal {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px);
    transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease;
  }
  .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

  /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hero-right { min-height: 50vw; padding: 40px; }
    .hero-left { padding: 60px 32px; }
    .hero-left::after { display: none; }
    .problems, .final-cta { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 60px; padding: 80px 32px; }
    .method { padding: 80px 32px; }
    .method-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2px; }
    .testimonials { padding: 80px 32px; }
    .test-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .test-header { flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; align-items: flex-start; }
    footer { flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; padding: 40px 32px; text-align: center; }
    .floating-stat { display: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-left">
    <span class="badge">Método de Relacionamento</span>
    <h1>Reconecte-se com quem você <em>ama</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-desc">Pare de lutar contra o silêncio e a distância. Descubra o método que já ajudou mais de 12.000 casais a restaurarem o amor verdadeiro.</p>
    <div class="cta-group">
      <a href="#preco" class="btn-primary">Quero Reconectar Agora</a>
      <a href="#metodo" class="btn-ghost">Como Funciona</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-right">
    <div class="floating-stat" style="top:12%;right:-10px">
      <span class="stat-num">97%</span>
      <span class="stat-label">Taxa de satisfação</span>
    </div>
    <div class="floating-stat" style="top:42%;left:-10px">
      <span class="stat-num">12k+</span>
      <span class="stat-label">Casais transformados</span>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-visual">
      <div class="couple-card">
        <p>Achávamos que nosso casamento havia acabado. Em 3 semanas de método, nos apaixonamos de novo.</p>
        <div class="couple-meta">
          <div class="avatar-pair">
            <div class="avatar">👩</div>
            <div class="avatar">👨</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="couple-name">Ana & Ricardo</span>
            <span class="couple-sub">Juntos há 12 anos · SP</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PROBLEMS -->
<section class="problems">
  <div class="problems-text reveal">
    <span class="section-label">Você se identifica?</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Relacionamentos <em>morrem</em> de silêncio lento</h2>
    <p>A distância não acontece de repente. Ela cresce na rotina, nas brigas sem resolução, nos toques que deixam de existir. Se você chegou até aqui, algo em você ainda quer lutar.</p>
  </div>

  <ul class="pain-list">
    <li class="pain-item">
      <span class="pain-num">01</span>
      <div class="pain-text">
        <h3>Conversas que viram brigas</h3>
        <p>Qualquer assunto difícil escala rapidamente e ninguém consegue realmente ouvir o outro.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="pain-item">
      <span class="pain-num">02</span>
      <div class="pain-text">
        <h3>Falta de intimidade e conexão</h3>
        <p>A cumplicidade foi se apagando. Vocês dormem no mesmo quarto mas parecem estranhos.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="pain-item">
      <span class="pain-num">03</span>
      <div class="pain-text">
        <h3>Sentimento de estar sozinho</h3>
        <p>Mesmo estando juntos, você se sente incompreendido, invisível e cada vez mais solitário.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="pain-item">
      <span class="pain-num">04</span>
      <div class="pain-text">
        <h3>Medo de perder a pessoa que ama</h3>
        <p>No fundo, você ainda ama. Mas não sabe como voltar àquela conexão que existia antes.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>

<!-- METHOD -->
<section class="method" id="metodo">
  <div class="method-header reveal">
    <span class="section-label">O Caminho de Volta</span>
    <h2 class="section-title" style="color:var(--cream)">O método <em>Amor Profundo</em></h2>
  </div>

  <div class="method-grid">
    <div class="method-card">
      <span class="method-icon">🔍</span>
      <h3>Diagnóstico</h3>
      <p>Identificamos exatamente onde a conexão foi rompida — padrões inconscientes de comunicação, feridas emocionais e gatilhos que sabotam seu relacionamento.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="method-card">
      <span class="method-icon">🗣️</span>
      <h3>Comunicação Real</h3>
      <p>Técnicas validadas pela neurociência para transformar conflitos em pontes. Você aprende a falar e, principalmente, a ouvir de verdade.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="method-card">
      <span class="method-icon">💞</span>
      <h3>Reconexão Profunda</h3>
      <p>Rituais diários simples que reacendem a intimidade emocional, física e espiritual — reconstruindo a cumplicidade que vocês um dia tiveram.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- TESTIMONIALS -->
<section class="testimonials">
  <div class="test-header reveal">
    <div>
      <span class="section-label">Histórias Reais</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">O amor que <em>voltou</em></h2>
    </div>
    <div style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:56px; font-weight:300; color:var(--rose); line-height:1">
      4.9 ★
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="test-grid">
    <div class="test-card featured reveal">
      <div class="test-stars">★★★★★</div>
      <p>Estávamos às vésperas do divórcio. Três filhos, 15 anos juntos — e parecia que tudo tinha acabado. O método me ensinou a ver meu marido de novo, como se fosse a primeira vez. Hoje somos mais felizes do que nos primeiros anos.</p>
      <div class="test-person">
        <div class="test-avatar">👩</div>
        <div>
          <span class="test-name">Fernanda M.</span>
          <span class="test-since">Juntos há 15 anos · RJ</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="test-small">
      <div class="test-card reveal">
        <div class="test-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p>Aprendi que o problema não era minha esposa, era a forma como eu me comunicava. Mudança real em semanas.</p>
        <div class="test-person">
          <div class="test-avatar">👨</div>
          <div>
            <span class="test-name">Carlos R.</span>
            <span class="test-since">BH · 8 anos juntos</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="test-card reveal" style="background:var(--deep)">
        <div class="test-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p style="color:var(--cream)">Voltamos a rir juntos. Parece simples, mas era o que mais fazia falta.</p>
        <div class="test-person">
          <div class="test-avatar" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1)">💑</div>
          <div>
            <span class="test-name" style="color:var(--cream)">Juliana & Paulo</span>
            <span class="test-since" style="color:rgba(250,246,242,0.5)">Porto Alegre</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
